WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
You're still reading. The screen dims.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
A build is running, and you need to close the lid.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Meet LidPilot.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Keep Screen On keeps your lecture, or long read, visible.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Keep Mac Running lets a build, download, or local AI task continue with the lid closed.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Follow Lid connects both.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Choose a timer. It starts Off, and you can stop any time.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A quiet, native menu-bar app.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Free and open source.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.000
LidPilot. Your Mac, on your time.
